@Atlas.API_HostAddress = https://localhost
# Paste values returned by the previous calls. Never commit real tokens or passwords.
@token = <access-token>
@userId = <user-guid>

### Login
POST {{Atlas.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "<password>" }

### Refresh (exchange the single-use refresh token for a new pair)
POST {{Atlas.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "<refresh-token>" }

### Logout (ends the session the refresh token belongs to)
POST {{Atlas.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "<refresh-token>" }

### Change password (required on first login)
POST {{Atlas.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "<current-password>", "newPassword": "<new-password>", "confirmNewPassword": "<new-password>" }

### Current user
GET {{Atlas.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create user (admin)
POST {{Atlas.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "jdoe", "password": "<temporary-password>", "role": "User" }

### List users (admin)
GET {{Atlas.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/users?page=1&pageSize=20&search=jd&isActive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get user (admin)
GET {{Atlas.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update user (admin)
PUT {{Atlas.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "jdoe", "role": "User" }

### Activate / deactivate (admin)
PATCH {{Atlas.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": false }

### Reset password (admin) - returns a one-time temporary password
POST {{Atlas.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
